 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Video Page Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a video landing page?\", \"a\": \"A video landing page is a standalone page built around one video, with a single action beside it, such as buying a course or booking a demo. The video does the explaining. The page around it holds the headline, the button, and the form that turns a viewer into a lead.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you build a landing page with video?\", \"a\": \"Start with the job the video does and the one action it leads to, then place the button where it works without playback. Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder'>AI landing page builder</a> creates a landing page with video from a prompt, including the player, the form, and a lead table that records watch time.\"}, {\"q\": \"How does a video sales letter differ from other types of video landing page?\", \"a\": \"A video sales letter carries the entire pitch in one long video, with little copy around it. On a VSL landing page, hold the order button back until the video reaches the offer. Demo and testimonial pages split the work between the copy and a shorter video.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are the benefits of a video in a landing page?\", \"a\": \"A video in a landing page can show a product working, or let a customer say what changed, faster than paragraphs can. It puts a face and a voice on the offer. It also yields data a static page lacks: how far each visitor watched before acting.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I find good video landing page examples?\", \"a\": \"Roundups from landing page builders and video companies collect video landing page examples, and design galleries add layouts. A screenshot hides the part that matters. When you study examples of landing pages with video, press play, scroll, and note the second the button appears. A <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/webinar-landing-page'>webinar landing page</a> with a replay belongs on the list too.\"}, {\"q\": \"What do landing page examples with video have in common?\", \"a\": \"The strongest landing page examples with video put the player next to the headline, not below the fold. The poster shows a face or the product. Captions are on by default, and the button sits outside the player where a silent visitor still sees it.\"}, {\"q\": \"Are video landing page templates worth using?\", \"a\": \"Video landing page templates save layout work, since the player and headline already sit in place. Wiring the form, the captions, and watch tracking is still on you. Emergent builds the page from a prompt instead, and it is free to start.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should video sales letter landing page templates include?\", \"a\": \"A VSL landing page template needs a player near the top, an order button timed to the offer, and an order form close below it. Link the form to a thank you page that confirms the order. A page Emergent builds saves every order request with no cap on responses.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is the best length for a landing page video?\", \"a\": \"As long as its one job takes. A demo that shows a single task can finish in about a minute, while a sales letter that carries the full pitch runs far longer. Check watch time per visitor, and if viewers keep leaving at the same second, cut there.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are the autoplay rules for landing page videos?\", \"a\": \"Chrome always allows muted autoplay, while autoplay with sound waits until the visitor has interacted with the site, with a few exceptions. Safari on iPhone also lets muted video start without a tap. Start landing page videos muted, and every play on a page Emergent builds is saved to a database you own.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
